1b:T7b3,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"搬瓦工是机场吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"不是。搬瓦工是 VPS（服务器）服务商，卖的是空服务器，翻墙要自己在上面搭。机场是开箱即用的代理订阅，导入即用。两者本质不同。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"搬瓦工的 IP 被墙了怎么办？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"搬瓦工的免费换 IP 已于 2019 年取消，现在被墙只能付费更换（约 8.79 美元／次），且新 IP 仍可能是被墙的。唯一免费的办法是在 KiwiVM 面板迁移到其他机房获得新 IP，但机房有限、新 IP 一样可能被封。这正是自建单 IP 的固有死穴，机场用分布式节点正好规避了它。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"搬瓦工搭的梯子晚上特别慢？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"单线路在晚高峰国际出口拥堵时没有备选，容易慢。CN2 GIA 平时快但并非万能。机场的多线路负载均衡在这一点上更有优势。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"只想翻墙，值得买搬瓦工自建吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"大多数人不值得。要会 Linux、要应对 IP 被墙且换 IP 要花钱、晚高峰还可能慢。只想稳定翻墙，买机场更省心、综合成本更低。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"搬瓦工有优惠码吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"额度很小且目前基本无可用常规码（2026 新年的 NODESEEK2026、2025 双十一的 ILOVEBANDWAGON 等都已失效）。它的价值在线路质量，真想省钱，抢「传家宝」$49.99 限量套餐比找码实在。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"搬瓦工官网是哪个？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"官方域名为 bandwagonhost.com（曾被 DNS 污染，解决后可访问）。注册前关闭代理、信息填真实，以免被判欺诈砍单。"}}]}11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1b"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"：搬瓦工（BandwagonHost／BWG）是"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"一家顶级 VPS 服务商，不是机场"}]}],["$","$1","3",{"children":"——它卖的是一台「裸服务器」，翻墙要你自己在上面搭。它确实强（加拿大 IT7 Networks 旗下、2004 年老牌、CN2 GIA 顶级线路、自研 KiwiVM 面板），「传家宝」$49.99／年的 CN2 GIA-E 套餐更是圈内传奇。但有一句实话："}],["$","$1","4",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"如果你只是想稳定翻墙看 YouTube、用 ChatGPT，自建搬瓦工大概率是性价比最低的选择"}]}],["$","$1","5",{"children":"——你要会 Linux、要应对单 IP 被墙（而且换 IP 要花钱）、晚高峰还可能慢。本文讲清「自建 VPS」和「买机场」的区别，帮你判断到底该折腾还是该直接买机场。"}]]}],"\n"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":["$","em",null,{"className":"text-[0.95em] text-muted not-italic","children":"核实于 2026-06-13 ｜ 搬瓦工套餐与优惠政策以官网为准"}]}],["$","hr",null,{"className":"my-10 border-rule"}],["$L1c",["$","h2",null,{"id":"一-搬瓦工是机场吗-先把这件事讲清","className":"mt-12 mb-4 scroll-mt-28 border-b border-rule pb-2 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight lg:scroll-mt-20","children":"一、搬瓦工是机场吗？——先把这件事讲清"}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"这是最多人搞混的地方。大量人搜「搬瓦工机场／搬瓦工梯子／搬瓦工官方机场」，但"}],["$","$1","1",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"搬瓦工严格来说不是机场"}]}],["$","$1","2",{"children":"："}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"table-scroll -mx-6 my-6 overflow-x-auto px-6 sm:mx-0 sm:px-0","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[30rem] border-collapse text-left text-sm","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"className":"border-b-2 border-foreground px-3 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap","children":"对比项"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"border-b-2 border-foreground px-3 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap","children":"机场（代理订阅）"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"border-b-2 border-foreground px-3 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap","children":"搬瓦工（VPS）"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"border-b border-rule px-3 py-2.5 align-top","children":"你买到的"}],"$L1d","$L1e"]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"]}]]}]